  "body": [
    "We connect millions of businesses and consumers globally. With solutions and insights for every stage of business.",
    "Sell globally. Get paid locally.",
    "Offer customers choice in how they pay",
    "Get access to a network of up to 400M active accounts¹",
    "Accept payments worldwide. Boost sales with our checkout stack built for growth. Offer customers popular ways to pay.",
    "No-code payment solutions",
    "Checkout and processing",
    "Scale your business with our suite of financial tools and end-to-end payment solutions.",
    "Show up in AI shopping experiences and get paid with confidence. Built on a foundation of reliability and trust.",
    "Agentic Commerce Services",
    "One platform for full stack processing, global scalability, and profitable business growth.",
    "Offer local payment methods in global markets. Turn browsers into buyers, even in agentic conversations.",
    "Global payment processing",
    "Agentic Commerce Services",
    "Enterprise omnichannel",
    "Scale your business profitably with our full suite of enterprise-grade payment solutions.",
    "Improve authorization rates. Minimize declines. And fight fraud. All the tools you need to optimize and protect your business.",
    "Run your day-to-day business with ease on a single platform for payments, management, and financial tools.",
    "Go from local to global in no time with our worldwide payment acceptance. And boost sales with the checkout that lets your customers pay their preferred way.",
    "Access capital on your terms. Get instant funding based on sales. Flexible loans. Plus 1% cash back on every eligible purchase with the PayPal Business Debit Card.2",
    "Prevent chargebacks and fraud. Save costs with discounted shipping rates. And run smarter actionable insights.",
    "Simple and quick payments, cash flow management, and growth funding all in one place. No requirements or credit check. Just your business account.",
    "Sell and get paid anywhere in just a few clicks. There's no coding involved. And you don't need a website, a storefront, or even any POS hardware.",
    "Easily increase and manage your cash flow. And access fast funding solutions that can help you build your business.",
    "Save time and make informed decisions with built-in reporting and insights. Plus Seller Protection on eligible transactions.3",
    "Shipping and tax calculation",
    "You’re in good company. Learn more about how PayPal Open is powering businesses of all sizes.",
    "“We were able to compensate several hundred million dollars in under a couple of weeks.”",
    "— Chris Priebe, Managing Director of Payments and Risk, Southwest Airlines",
    "“Stability is paramount both on our systems and our payment stack. PayPal's just been an incredibly reliable partner.”",
    "— Pranay Reddy, VP eCommerce Business and Development, Ticketmaster",
    "\"PayPal strives to revolutionize the digital commerce space, just as HelloFresh strives to do so in the food solutions space. PayPal is giving us the tools and support to further grow our business.\"",
    "— Emina Zahirovic, Associate Director of Global Payments, HelloFresh",
    "Get API credentials, demo product experiences, and participate in our developer community.",
    "The platform designed to power commerce."
  ],
